  "StockRole": "Ultraheavy ProtoMech",
  "YangsThoughts": "The original Hobgoblin did so badly in the original Society rebellion it nearly got scrapped. However, the Society kept the tooling, and enough people lobbied to give it a second chance and here it is. The largest change was converting it to an OmniProto, but they also added some more space for upgrades. The engine and sensors were kept from the original, so it's slower, but the Magnetic Clamps get around that.",
